   "h2": "The endings",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "p": "Chapter 1 has two families of nouns, called <b>declensions</b>. 1st declension nouns end in <em>-a</em> and are nearly all feminine. The 2nd declension nouns here end in <em>-us</em> and are masculine."
    },
